_6621515077070126422_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=9Hr1EXKLElAQ7kNvwHnd-Tl&_nc_oc=Adl8L6DdxYwtQlGaWkC2qSPXZ2nDUw_pBsHlCmOdLC1-ic4VBmYod_MhvarEmuQ1EjU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfxL0cE8Wuh8yjLaGlDh5Ov57H2_bdfnxLWCk502artrhg&oe=69AAAF12"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "landscape.png", "id": "1361199002222552", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821782_1361199005555885_917954452052319403_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nZJpQTG9BW8Q7kNvwFFrHE-&_nc_oc=AdkF9EOTycxV5BwAJS8edtWlC2l3cNM-KRnbrRc2kq68RwKit9tg1pgYJGf38Np-cvk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afwd7kBQP15oVuHTvXa84CrR_lFUCT_lRNNt3LH0vbiDHg&oe=69AAD850"}, "display_name": "Dig To Escape", "keywords": ["Prison", "Escape", "Dig", "Jail", "Fun"], "long_description": "# Dig to Escape\n\n**Grab your shovel and get digging!**  \n\nOutsmart sneaky moles, brawl with inmates, and take on wacky quests as you tunnel your way to freedom in the wildest prison break ever!\n\n**Dig for upgrades**\n\nCollect minerals and sell them to upgrade your tools. Better gear means bigger digs and more ways to escape.\n\n{2046789639497740}\n\n**Watch out for the mole**\n\nA sneaky thief is after your loot. Catch him before he makes off with your hard-earned minerals!\n\n{1547839482800416}\n\n**Be the inmate boss**\n\nBully, outsmart, or intimidate other inmates\n\n\n\n\n{1551401099280034}", "short_description": "Grab your shovel and get digging! Outsmart sneaky moles, brawl with Inmates, and take on wacky quests as you tunnel your way to freedom in the wildest prison break ever!"}]}, "developer_name": "K&K Studio", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://smallpdf.com/file#s=5c5ab8e5-9c2e-4705-ad6f-3598c05f6127", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "K&K Studio", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://knk-studio.com/", "category": null, "comfort_